{"type":"message","id":"817cf079","parentId":"447aafd7","timestamp":"2026-03-14T10:27:50.259Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The main page loaded successfully. The original URL http://www.siming.gov.cn/gbmzl/kjhxxhj/ returns a 404 File Not Found error. This page may have been moved or the URL changed. \n\nLooking at the structure, there's a \"政务公开\" (Government Affairs Disclosure) section and a \"政策文件库\" (Policy Document Library). Let me try to find the correct URL for the Science and Information Technology Bureau (科技和信息化局).\n\nLet me try to find links that might lead to the correct page.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"原始URL返回404。让我尝试找到正确的页面路径：\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_1560c7b828d5470fa712a87b","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"python3 -c \"\nfrom playwright.sync_api import sync_playwright\nimport re\n\nwith sync_playwright() as p:\n    browser = p.chromium.launch(headless=True)\n    page = browser.new_page()\n    \n    page.goto('http://www.siming.gov.cn/', timeout=30000)\n    page.wait_for_load_state('networkidle')\n    page.wait_for_timeout(1000)\n    \n    # 找所有包含科技、信息相关关键词的链接\n    links = page.query_selector_all('a')\n    \n    print('包含科技/信息的链接:')\n    for link in links:\n        try:\n            href = link.get_attribute('href')\n            text = link.inner_text().strip() if link.inner_text() else ''\n            if href and ('科技' in text or '信息化' in text or 'kjh' in href.lower() or 'xxhj' in href.lower()):\n                print(f'{text} -> {href}')\n        except:\n            pass\n    \n    # 搜索政府信息公开目录\n    print('\\\\n政府信息公开目录:')\n    page.goto('http://www.siming.gov.cn/zfxxgkzl/', timeout=30000)\n    page.wait_for_load_state('networkidle')\n    links = page.query_selector_all('a')\n    for link in links[:50]:\n        try:\n            href = link.get_attribute('href')\n            text = link.inner_text().strip()[:30] if link.inner_text() else ''\n            if href and len(text) > 0:\n                print(f'{text} -> {href}')\n        except:\n            pass\n    \n    browser.close()\n\"","timeout":90}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"volces-com","model":"ark-code-latest","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1773484043499}}
