{"type":"message","id":"88abb38d","parentId":"88b9b6c0","timestamp":"2026-03-14T10:30:17.976Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"看起来这个页面是法定主动公开内容的主页面，而不是具体的通知公告列表页。我需要找到实际的公告列表页面。\n\n根据之前的搜索结果，我看到有一个链接是：\n`./zfxxgkzl/gbmxxgk/kjhxxhj/zfxxgkml/tzgg/202603/t20260305_1139617.htm`\n\n这表明通知公告在 `tzgg` 子目录下。让我尝试访问通知公告列表页面。\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_dc262f44917347ab918b4a3c","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"python3 -c \"\nfrom playwright.sync_api import sync_playwright\nimport os\n\noutput_dir = os.path.expanduser('~/.openclaw/workspace/skills/adaptive-announcement-scraper/output/2026-03-14/')\n\nwith sync_playwright() as p:\n    browser = p.chromium.launch(headless=True)\n    page = browser.new_page()\n    \n    # 尝试访问通知公告列表页面\n    url = 'http://www.siming.gov.cn/zfxxgkzl/gbmxxgk/kjhxxhj/zfxxgkml/tzgg/'\n    page.goto(url, timeout=30000)\n    page.wait_for_load_state('networkidle')\n    page.wait_for_timeout(2000)\n    \n    print('标题:', page.title())\n    \n    # 保存页面\n    with open(os.path.join(output_dir, 'tzgg.html'), 'w', encoding='utf-8') as f:\n        f.write(page.content())\n    \n    browser.close()\n    print('Saved tzgg.html')\n\"","timeout":60}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"volces-com","model":"ark-code-latest","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1773484197072}}
